messages:  [['Please reason step by step to solve the logical reasoning problem. After completing the your step-by-step reasoning process, give your final answer in the following format: "\\nThe correct option is: A/B/C/D".\n####\n# Context:\nObject administrative culture means that individuals, groups and organizations, as the objects of administrative management, make a reasonable evaluation of the behavior of administrative subjects (mainly administrative organs), and their evaluation criteria will be diverse due to their different interests.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, according to the above definition, which of the followings belongs to object administrative culture?\n# Options:\nA) A local environmental protection department strengthened the supervision of seriously polluting enterprises, and its serious law enforcement attitude was highly praised by the local people\nB) Xiao wang is a staff member of a government department. his work is serious and responsible. his leaders and comrades in charge think xiao wang is a qualified worker\nC) Zhang, the self-employed operator, failed to pay taxes as required, and the tax department issued a notice to him to pay taxes within a time limit. zhang not only ignored it, but also blamed the tax department for not taxing him\nD) In order to support the development of local small and medium-sized enterprises, the industrial and commercial department of a city implemented preferential policies for these enterprises according to relevant laws and regulations, which was welcomed by the majority of small and medium-sized enterprise operators\n\n# Instruction:\n## Reasoning:', '. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
