messages:  [['Please reason step by step to solve the logical reasoning problem. After completing the your step-by-step reasoning process, give your final answer in the following format: "\\nThe correct option is: A/B/C/D".\n####\n# Context:\nIn the winter of 2008, more than 1/3 of commercial beehives in the United States developed colony collapse syndrome. All worker bees in some colonies suddenly disappear or die, leaving only lonely queens in the hives. The syndrome has spread to many European countries, such as France, Belgium, Italy, Portugal and Spain. Without these bees, many crops related to human life would not exist, such as soybeans, cotton, apricots, sunflowers and so on. Almost 1/3 of the world\'s food is related to the behavior of bees. If they become extinct, it will be followed by serious social problems such as serious food shortages, hunger, violence and riots.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options cannot be inferred from the original text?\n# Options:\nA) Queen bees are more resistant to colony collapse syndrome than worker bees.\nB) The syndrome of colony collapse in the united states is earlier than that in europe.\nC) Colony collapse syndrome can lead to serious social problems.\nD) Lack of food is the main reason for the disappearance of worker bees.\n\n# Instruction:\n## Reasoning:', '. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
