messages:  [['Please reason step by step to solve the logical reasoning problem. After completing the your step-by-step reasoning process, give your final answer in the following format: "\\nThe correct option is: A/B/C/D".\n####\n# Context:\nIn public speeches, some people talk long and talk endlessly; some people condense their meaning into one sentence, and this sentence is like a heavy stone, stirring up waves in the calm mind of the audience It is commendable and memorable. On October 19, 1936, at the meeting of people from all walks of life in Shanghai to sacrifice Lu Xun, my country\'s famous journalist, politician, and social activist Mr. Zou Taofen delivered a speech of only 33 words: Not too soon, I would like to commemorate Mr. with one sentence: Many people have fallen without a fight, and Mr. Lu Xun has fallen without a fight.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is the main expression of this text?\n# Options:\nA) Short speeches, such as zou taofen\'s one-sentence speech, have profound meaning and strong expressive effects\nB) The phrase unyielding in battle accurately outlines mr. lu xun\'s fighting spirit\nC) The word war contains how much people admire and praise mr. lu xun\nD) Many shameless literati not only do not fight, but also slave their hands and knees; but the gentleman\'s eyebrows are cold and stubborn\n\n# Instruction:\n## Reasoning:', '. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
