 manager of aetna trading company signed a contract for the purchase and sale of flax silk with a printing and dyeing factory, with a total contract amount of 7.8 million yuan. according to the agreement between the two sides, the printing and dyeing factory should pay aetna trading company 1.56 million yuan according to 20% of the contract amount as a good faith to perform the contract, but the printing and dyeing factory was very short of funds, so it couldn\'t get so much money at the moment, so it pieced together to pay 1 million yuan.\n\n# Instruction:\n## Reasoning:', '. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
