messages:  [['Please reason step by step to solve the logical reasoning problem. After completing the your step-by-step reasoning process, give your final answer in the following format: "\\nThe correct option is: A/B/C/D".\n####\n# Context:\nSpiritual support: It means that in family life, children understand, respect, care, consider their parents, and try their best to meet their spiritual needs.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following does not belong to spiritual support?\n# Options:\nA) Lao sun recently bought an lcd tv and installed it in his parents\' room, so that the two old people can watch their favorite programs, and he also bought many peking opera cds for them.\nB) Although lao wu did not live with his parents, he has developed the habit of visiting every day for many years, taking care of their lives meticulously, and the elderly are very pleased.\nC) As the spring festival is approaching, dean li of the sunset red nursing home invited the little red flower orchestra of chaoyang primary school. the children\'s laughter and wonderful performances brought endless happiness to the elderly.\nD) Lao jiang\'s mother is in her 70s, but she still refuses to accept her old age. she signed up for a ballroom dancing training class. in order to prevent the elderly from getting angry and to ensure their safety, lao jiang quietly followed behind every time her mother went to class.\n\n# Instruction:\n## Reasoning:', '. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
