messages:  [['Please reason step by step to solve the logical reasoning problem. After completing the your step-by-step reasoning process, give your final answer in the following format: "\\nThe correct option is: A/B/C/D".\n####\n# Context:\nIn some grass-roots units, the masses always talk back to cadres, and some even cause emotional antagonism between the cadres and the masses. The main reason is that some grass-roots cadres ignore the defensive psychology of the masses. Psychologists believe that when people are criticized by others, they instinctively develop a sense of defense, that is, the psychology of defense. Even if they have done obvious and unshirkable mistakes, some people will explain several objective reasons to justify themselves and dilute the adverse effects of their obsolescence. Generally speaking, defense psychology mainly has the following two manifestations: one is to explain the problem through defense and the other is to evade responsibility.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, according to the above text, which of the following options is correct?\n# Options:\nA) The reason why the masses defend themselves is to let the cadres find out the real situation.\nB) Grass-roots cadres should distinguish different situations and correctly deal with their defense towards the masses.\nC) People who do something wrong but take a fluke in order to evade responsibility are easy to have a defensive psychology.\nD) The dispute between grass-roots cadres and the masses is due to the neglect of the defensive psychology of the masses.\n\n# Instruction:\n## Reasoning:', '. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
